 ### Opacity Loss
-An AOV loss encouraging rendering throughput to equal 1.0 in regions where a binary object mask is active. Formula: $L = w \cdot \frac{1}{N} \sum_{i=1}^{N} m_i \cdot |T_i - 1|$. Weight $w$ typically 1.0 [S5, unofficial].
